sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest (chargingProfile.id = <Configured chargingProfileId>)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId 0 AND<br>chargingProfile.stackLevel <Configured stackLevel> AND<br>chargingProfile.chargingProfilePurpose ChargingStationMaxProfile AND<br>chargingProfile.chargingProfileKind Absolute<br>chargingProfile.chargingSchedule.chargingRateUnit <Configured ChargingRateUnit><br>chargingProfile.chargingSchedule.duration <Configured duration><br>chargingProfile.chargingSchedule.chargingSchedulePeriod.startPeriod 0<br>chargingProfile.chargingSchedule.chargingSchedulePeriod.limit 8.0 or 8000.0<br>chargingProfile.chargingSchedule.chargingSchedulePeriod.numberPhases <Configured numberPhases> where <Configured numberPhases> not 3 OR<br>chargingProfile.chargingSchedule.chargingSchedulePeriod.numberPhases <Configured numberPhases> or <omit> where <Configured numberPhases> 3<br>chargingProfile.chargingSchedule.startSchedule <Not omitted>

    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
